  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in projected paging: ToProjectedPagedAsync, ToProjectedCursorPagedAsync and IProjectedPaginatedMapper (registered by AddMapFluxPagination) let the database select only the columns the DTO map reads. Filters, search, sorting and cursors still use entity properties; cursors stay compatible. A map that cannot be projected throws instead of falling back to memory. Depends on MapFlux 1.3.0. Existing methods are unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
